⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
249 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, including toppings and mix-ins)

Dirt Cake Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 7g (1 tbsp) vanilla pudding mix
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 4 @OREO Thins, cream removed (3 mixed in, 1 crumbled on top)
- 15g (1 tbsp) Lakanto Chocolate Sauce
249 cal 38g C, 2g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with 3 of the Oreos
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Drizzle with the chocolate sauce
9. Crumble the final Oreo on top

